<title>USA: Heartland Partners LP Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Heartland Partners LP Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per unit data, unaudited)</p>
<p>						  Consolidated Operations</p>
<p>				     Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					 September 30,    September 30,</p>
<p>				    1996    1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p> Total Net Revenue	   $4,777   $966	$6,408   $2,498</p>
<p> Total Expenses		 1,632  1,443	 4,788    5,823</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)	    3,145  (477)	 1,620  (3,325)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) Per</p>
<p>  Class A Unit (A)	     1.45  (.22)	   .75   (1.53)</p>
<p>    (A)    Net income (loss) per Class A Unit is computed by</p>
<p>dividing net income (loss), after deducting the general partner's return and the return of the Class B interest, by 2,142,438 Class A units outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
